   "text": "Relationship in plain words, plus the\nblind-first switch. When on, the AI\npanel stays hidden until you record your\nown first call.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Relationship in plain words, plus the\nblind-first switch. When on, the AI\npanel stays hidden until you record your\nown first call.",
