   "text": "Ten deterministic guards. A failing\nguard names the reason and blocks the\nmerge action, so the AI cannot override\nit.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Ten deterministic guards. A failing\nguard names the reason and blocks the\nmerge action, so the AI cannot override\nit.",
