   "text": "AI proposal, marked with the diamond.\nVerdict, vote agreement, verbatim quotes\nand the next step. \"Why was this\nsuggested?\" opens model, prompt version\nand inputs.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
